  "sourceTitle": "Blue Cheese Dip/dressing",
  "sourceText": "Blue Cheese Dip/dressing\nBy: Leah Rodrigues\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 12:04am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 tablespoons Green Onion, minced\n4 tablespoons Fresh parsley, chopped\n4 ounces Blue cheese, crumbled\n1 cup Mayonnaise\n1/2 cup Sour cream\n1 tablespoon Lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Whisk all ingredients together. Chill for an hour or more to let flavor develop before serving.",
